{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>ADHD Tool 是一款一次只保留一項任務的待辦工具，適合容易因長清單而分心、需要把注意力放回當下的人。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-205.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>一次只做一件事</h2>\n<p>Do This 每次只顯示一項任務，不設清單、截止日期或繁複設定。任務常駐於鎖定畫面、動態島及主畫面小工具，也可在鎖定畫面、小工具或 Apple Watch 直接完成。另備可選提醒、安靜計時、誤按撤銷、Siri 與捷徑支援，一次買斷且無訂閱、無廣告、免帳戶。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-230-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-231-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-232-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-233-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-234-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：ADHD Tool – Do This</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/adhd-tool-do-this/id6563141268?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T21:43:45.515465+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":271,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T21:18:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:47.621605+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T21:37:15.066667+00:00","content_hash":"5d566c4586b01f8a951da21d6fceda83e1811364d1022b326250dc5226c9fcd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}